cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "sommieR: Unified Forest Register with Evidential Value"
abstract: >
  Implement the unified forest register (sommier) as a system of permanent,
  strictly append-only records covering the three French forest regimes
  (state, communal, and private under a simple management plan). Entries form
  a hash-chained journal over an RFC 8785 canonical JSON serialisation,
  enforced in PostGIS by immutability triggers, so that any third party can
  verify an export offline without trusting the server.
